  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4l2xQ83.png\" alt=\"applecrates\" width=\"1127\" height=\"164\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong>蘋果木箱</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>交易與裝飾</em></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">蘋果木箱新增基於原版木材類型的方塊，讓你可以儲存和交易物品！<br><br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">這些方塊能讓你存放物品。它們擁有29格空間，比儲物箱多兩格，</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">還額外具備簡易商店的功能！</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">合成配方需要3個木材板和2根木棒。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">簡單、容易、隨時可用！</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>漏斗支援：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\">1.19.2 - 2.8.0版本新增漏斗支援。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\">從後方連接漏斗即可自動補貨！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\">不支援付款槽位。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/35X5oIj.png\" alt=\"hopper support\" width=\"407\" height=\"229\"></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>支援模組：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">蘋果樹苗：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/applesaplings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">內建支援！</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">繽紛杜鵑：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/azalea-crates\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">杜鵑木箱</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">生態多樣：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/plenty-crates\" rel=\"nofollow\">多樣木箱</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">生態漫遊：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/byg-crates\" rel=\"nofollow\">BYG木箱</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">整合動態：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-crates\" rel=\"nofollow\">動態木箱</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">植物魔法：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botanical-crates\" rel=\"nofollow\">植物木箱</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">瑪魯姆：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/malumian-crates\" rel=\"nofollow\">瑪魯姆木箱</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">高級木材：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/premium-crates\" rel=\"nofollow\">高級木箱</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">豐碩之趣：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fruit-crates\" rel=\"nofollow\">水果木箱</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">啟蒙終界：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enlightened-crates\" rel=\"nofollow\">啟蒙木箱</a><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">太陽工藝：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/solar-crates\" rel=\"nofollow\">太陽木箱</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">匠魂：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/construct-crates\" rel=\"nofollow\">匠魂木箱</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">禁忌秘法：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forbidden-crates\" rel=\"nofollow\">禁忌木箱</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">地質世代：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/firma-crates\" rel=\"nofollow\">地質木箱</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Riaw_d1tlz4?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>1.2.0版本新功能：</p><p><strong>無限商店：<a href=\"https://github.com/ArtixAllMighty/AppleCrates/wiki/Unlimited-Shops\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">維基條目</a></strong></p><p>將木箱轉為無限制的商店！（僅限具備指令權限的伺服器管理員使用）</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Forge：目前支援</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Fabric：已支援</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Quilt：計劃中<br><br><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">[1.19.2之前版本]內建支援：</span></strong><br></span></p><p>植物魔法</p><p>生態漫遊</p><p>瑪魯姆</p><p>禁忌秘法</p><p>高級木材</p><p>生態多樣</p><p>果樹模組</p><p>啟蒙終界</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Am6SHjW.png\" alt=\"support\" width=\"415\" height=\"353\"><br><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">歡迎來我的Discord伺服器交流！建議與錯誤回報永遠歡迎</span></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/8MEdFZh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/fr/4/4f/Discord_Logo_sans_texte.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"71\" height=\"80\"></a></p>",
